WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.697
Ordinal variables have a meaningful order Emergent
is more severe

00:00:05.723 --> 00:00:11.294
than urgent and urgent is more severe than
non-urgent But the distance

00:00:11.321 --> 00:00:17.118
between those levels is not necessarily equal That
means numeric codes

00:00:17.144 --> 00:00:22.830
can preserve rank while still requiring caution
Medians percentiles

00:00:22.962 --> 00:00:28.027
and ordered displays often respect the structure
better than treating the values as ordinary
continuous

00:00:28.041 --> 00:00:28.554
numbers
